# Keep LF in the working tree, not just in the repo.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) a checkout rewrites these
# to CRLF, so every `git add` prints a conversion warning and tooling that writes
# them back can flip a whole file to CRLF in one diff. Pinning the endings keeps
# diffs limited to the lines that actually changed.
#
# This does NOT guard skill loading: CRLF frontmatter in a SKILL.md was tested
# directly and parses correctly, description intact.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
